OL,3,GNEWSACrews tackle scrubland fire near
OL,4,Afootball stadium
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters have been tackling a blaze
OL,7,Finvolving bushes and fly-tipped waste
OL,8,Fclose to a football stadium.
OL,10,FNorthamptonshire Fire and Rescue
OL,11,FService said it was called to scrubland
OL,12,Foff Walter Tull Way, near to
OL,13,FNorthampton Town's Sixfields ground, at
OL,14,F16:10 BST.
OL,16,FCrews extinguished the fire, but
OL,17,Fremained on scene to dampen down hot
OL,18,Fspots.
OL,23,APub: 24-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
